  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0179" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00538/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_hughes">
              <opener>
                <seg hand="#print_pbs">
                  <orgName>
                    <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_446">The Poetry Book Society Ltd</rs>
                  </orgName>
                  <placeName>
                    <address>
                      <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_703">4 ST JAMES'S SQUARE LONDON SW1</rs>
                    </address>
                  </placeName>
                      <lb/>TELEPHONE: WHITEHALL 9737
                      <lb/>
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_pbs">
                  <lb/>Board of Management: Chairman: <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_711">ROY FULLER</rs><space quantity="2" unit="char"/>Secretary: <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_712">ERIC W. WHITE</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_713">PROFESSOR BONAMY DOBREE, O.B.E.</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_714">P. F. du SAUTOY, O.B.E.</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_715">FRANCIS HOPE</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_716">JOHN LEHMANN, C.B.E.</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_8">STEPHEN SPENDER, C.B.E.</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_717">JON STALLWORTHY</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_718">PROFESSOR C. A. TRYPANIS</rs> (GREEK)
                </seg>
                <seg>
                  <placeName>
                    <address>
                      <lb/><space quantity="45" unit="char"/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_704">Court Green
                      <lb/><space quantity="45" unit="char"/>North Tawton
                      <lb/><space quantity="45" unit="char"/>Devon, England</rs>
                    </address>
                  </placeName>
                </seg>
                <dateline>
                  <date>
                    <lb/><space quantity="45" unit="char"/>l4th Septemebr 66
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <seg>
                  <persName>
                    <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">W.H.Auden</rs> Esq., 
                  </persName>
                  <lb/>C/O <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_5">Faber &amp; Faber Ltd.</rs>,
                  <placeName>
                    <address>
                      <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_44">24 Russell Square L
                      <lb/>London W.C.l</rs>
                    </address>
                  </placeName>
                </seg>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Mr Auden</rs>,
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="16" unit="char"/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_446">We</rs> would be delighted if you would consider
                <lb/>accepting our invitation to be our guest, here in <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_56">London</rs>, from
                <lb/>the l2th to the l6th of July, l967, at an International
                <lb/>Festival of Spoken Poetry, and to read from your poems as part
                <lb/>of the programme.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="5" unit="char"/>The Festival is to be held by the <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_446">Poetry Book Society</rs>,
                <lb/>under the sponsorship of the <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_366">Arts Council</rs>.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>Among those being
                <lb/>invited, besides yourself, are <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_374">Ingeborg Bachmann</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_719">Paul Celan</rs>,
                <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_720">Eugenio Montale</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_721">Andrei Voznesensky</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_722">Neruda</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_723">Yehuda Amic<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_hughes">j</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_hughes">h</add></subst>ai</rs>,
                <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_724">Miroslav Holub</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_725">Robert Lowell</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_320">Zbigniew Herbert</rs>, <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_367">Janos Pilinszky</rs>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="5" unit="char"/>For the five days of the Festival we shall provide five
                <lb/>pounds per day expenses.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>For travel, we shall try to draw your
                <lb/>fare from some other source, but failing that we shall provide
                <lb/>up to fifty pounds.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>On top of that there will be a fee of
                <lb/>about forty pounds.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="5" unit="char"/>Needless to say, we are very much hoping you will be
                <lb/>able to come.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="5" unit="char"/>We would be grateful if you could let us have a reply as
                <lb/>soon as possible.
              </p>
              <closer>
                <salute>
                  <lb/><space quantity="23" unit="char"/>Yours sincerely
                </salute >
                <signed hand="#hand_black_hughes">
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_710">Ted Hughes</rs>
                </signed>
                <signed>
                  <lb/><space quantity="29" unit="char"/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_710">Ted Hughes</rs>
                </signed>
              </closer>
              <postscript>
                <ab>
                  <lb/>I am enclosing a <rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_486">Magazine</rs> I have occasionally thought you
                  <lb/>might like to see.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>The second issue, mainly French, is just
                  <lb/>out, and I'll be sending you that too.
                </ab>
              </postscript>
             </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00539/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0179">
                <lb/>37
              </ab>
            </div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </body>
